  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon League\n",
        "Victory Road Entrance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems that CELEBI has made you\n",
        "travel through time...\f",
        "to the past!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: You told me...\n",
        "you were the number one in the world!\r",
        "Are you gonna quit?\r",
        "What are you going to do now?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: What aspect of you was\n",
        "number one?\r",
        "Gathering so many only to be defeated\n",
        "by a mere child!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I don’t understand you!\r",
        "You don’t make any sense!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: I don’t want to\n",
        "understand you!\r",
        "I will never become someone like you.\r",
        "A coward when you’re alone and\n",
        "acting like a tyrant when you’re in\f",
        "front of other cowards!\r",
        "I will become strong!\r",
        "I will become a stronger man all\n",
        "by myself!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00006",
      "en_US": "{SIZE 200}All by myself!{SIZE 100}\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...What are you\n",
        "staring at?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "..................\r",
        "One must acknowledge one’s defeat\n",
        "before he can move on...\r",
        "I will go solo...for now...\r",
        "So that one day I will form\n",
        "a stronger organization!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Putting together the potential of many\n",
        "is how you produce a huge power...\f",
        "That’s what an organization is...\r",
        "That’s the strength of\n",
        "an organization!\r",
        "I failed...to make the best use of\n",
        "my subordinates’ potential...!\r",
        "But you shall witness one day\n",
        "the revival of me and my {COLOR 1}Team Rocket{COLOR 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "..................\n",
        "One day, you will understand.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00011",
      "en_US": "Ethan: Where are we...?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00012",
      "en_US": "Lyra: Where are we...?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: Ilex Forest has disappeared!\r",
        "...That’s not it.\n",
        "It’s more like we have been\f",
        "transported somewhere else...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Ilex Forest has disappeared!\r",
        "...That’s not it.\n",
        "It’s more like we have been\f",
        "transported somewhere else...?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, something is strange!\r",
        "I heard the radio mentioning\n",
        "the date from three years ago!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, something is strange!\r",
        "I heard the radio mentioning\n",
        "the date from three years ago!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0360_R22_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Is that...am I looking at...\n",
        "CELEBI?\r",
        "That explains it!\n",
        "CELEBI must have caused all this!\r",
        "My grandpa once told me that\n",
        "CELEBI can travel through time using\f",
        "its mystic power called {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}!\r",
        "CELEBI must have taken us back in time!\n",
        "Literally!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
